---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import profilePicture from "../assets/profile-picture.png";
import sectionGradient from "../assets/section_gradient.svg";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

// Welcome to Astro! Wondering what to do next? Check out the Astro documentation at https://docs.astro.build
// Don't want to use any of this? Delete everything in this file, the `assets`, `components`, and `layouts` directories, and start fresh.
---

<Layout>
	<main class="">
		<div class="">
			<div
				class="absolute -top-32 left-0 -z-10 h-[700px] w-full -rotate-6 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_101.73%_140.07%_at_30.39%_0.00%,_#1A1A1A_54%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.50)_100%)]"
			>
			</div>
			<div
				class="absolute top-0 left-0 -z-10 h-[450px] w-full bg-(image:--gradient)"
			>
			</div>
			<section class="relative container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-12 md:px-12">
				<div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="z-10">
						<div class="relative ps-12">
							<div
								class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/50 to-transparent"
							>
							</div>
							<div class="py-8 font-mono text-4xl text-white">Hey, ich bin</div>
							<div
								class="h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white/40 to-transparent"
							>
							</div>
							<div class="text-primary py-8 font-mono text-6xl">Tim</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="z-10 mt-1">
						<div
							class="relative w-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 shadow-[0px_0px_70px_10px_rgba(198,113,83,0.25)] outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="absolute -top-12 right-10 z-20 aspect-square w-28 md:w-32"
							>
								<div
									class="bg-background absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-white/20 shadow-[0px_0px_36px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]"
								>
								</div>
								<div
									class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_100.04%_130.58%_at_31.37%_0.00%,_#D94A17_0%,_rgba(231.54,_85.68,_33.66,_0.55)_62%,_rgba(193.80,_133.96,_112.20,_0.10)_100%)]"
								>
								</div>
								<Image
									src={profilePicture}
									alt="Tim Schulz Portrait"
									class="absolute bottom-0 w-full rounded-full"
								/>
							</div>
							<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
								<div
									class="self-stretch font-mono text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
								>
									Über mich
								</div>
								<p
									class="self-stretch font-sans text-base leading-normal text-white"
								>
									Ich habe Informatik studiert und entwickle seit Jahren
									Websites und Webanwendungen. Mein Fokus liegt auf einer
									durchdachten User Experience — Anwendungen sollen nicht nur
									funktionieren, sondern sich gut bedienen lassen.
								</p>
								<p
									class="self-stretch font-sans text-base leading-normal text-white"
								>
									Als IT-Berater und Anwendungsentwickler setze ich Projekte in
									unterschiedlichsten Bereichen um: Von der Restrukturierung
									gewachsener Systeme bis hin zu individuellen Webanwendungen.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="container mx-auto mt-32 max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-12">
				<div
					class="relative inline-flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-16 self-stretch"
				>
					<Image
						src={sectionGradient}
						alt=""
						class="absolute -top-0 -z-10 h-72 w-full scale-150 overflow-visible bg-center bg-no-repeat"
					/>
					<div
						class="justify-start self-stretch text-center font-mono text-5xl leading-[48px] font-normal text-white"
					>
						Skills
					</div>
					<div class="inline-flex items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch">
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Websites
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Seit einigen Jahren ist das erstellen von Webseiten meine
								Spezialität.
							</div>
						</div>
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Webapps
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Aute quis velit elit aliquip eiusmod eiusmod dolore tempor
								cillum mollit sit. Enim aute ad labore mollit voluptate et
								incididunt non ex pariatur ex sit commodo quis. Incididunt
								pariatur in commodo ad<br />proident id nulla officia cillum
								sint sunt adipisicing qui adipisicing. Consequat nulla velit
								occaecat est et culpa deserunt aute magna proident sunt aute
								labore dolore nisi. Amet quis eiusmod commodo adipisicing.
							</div>
						</div>
						<div
							class="inline-flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-start gap-4 self-stretch overflow-hidden bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_113.17%_241.11%_at_41.02%_112.41%,_rgba(26,_26,_26,_0.20)_0%,_rgba(126,_126,_126,_0.14)_100%)] p-8 outline outline-1 outline-offset-[-1px] outline-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
						>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Mono'] text-4xl leading-9 font-normal text-white"
							>
								Beratung
							</div>
							<div
								class="justify-start self-stretch font-['Fira_Sans'] text-base leading-normal font-normal text-white"
							>
								Aute quis velit elit aliquip eiusmod eiusmod dolore tempor
								cillum mollit sit. Enim aute ad labore mollit voluptate et
								incididunt non ex pariatur ex sit commodo quis. Incididunt
								pariatur in commodo ad<br />proident id nulla officia cillum
								sint sunt adipisicing qui adipisicing. Consequat nulla velit
								occaecat est et culpa deserunt aute magna proident sunt aute
								labore dolore nisi. Amet quis eiusmod commodo adipisicing.
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
